<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head') %>
<body>

  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-soft-gradient position-relative overflow-hidden text-center">
    <div class="backdrop-glow"></div>
    <div class="container position-relative z-3">
      <div class="max-width-800 mx-auto">
        <span class="badge-category mb-3">Answers</span>
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-extrabold mb-4" style="color: #182033;">
          Frequently Asked <span class="text-primary-pink">Questions</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="lead text-muted mb-0">
          Find transparent responses regarding privacy, call connections, billing policies, and boundaries.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ Accordion section -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-white border-divider">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-9">
          <div class="accordion" id="mainFaqAccordion">
            
            <!-- Q1 -->
            <div class="accordion-item accordion-item-custom">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button accordion-button-custom" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q1">
                  What is this service?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="q1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#mainFaqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                  Talk With Ashu is a voice emotional support line. It connects individuals going through loneliness, emotional weight, stressful days, or simple needs to share with a warm, caring, and dedicated listening companion over a phone line.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Q2 -->
            <div class="accordion-item accordion-item-custom">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button accordion-button-custom collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q2">
                  How does the voice call work?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="q2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#mainFaqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                  All calls are handled securely inside our web app interface. Once you log in and click "Start Call", the call is routed through our private servers. No personal phone numbers are ever revealed, maintaining complete privacy.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Q3 -->
            <div class="accordion-item accordion-item-custom">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button accordion-button-custom collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q3">
                  How do coins work?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="q3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#mainFaqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                  Our service uses a simple coin-to-minute ratio. <strong>1 Coin = 1 Minute of conversation.</strong> Coins deduct dynamically as the call proceeds. If a call is 8 minutes and 24 seconds, 9 coins will be consumed.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Q4 -->
            <div class="accordion-item accordion-item-custom">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button accordion-button-custom collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q4">
                  How much does one call cost?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="q4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#mainFaqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                  There is no flat connection rate. Call pricing depends entirely on the plan you select when purchasing coins. Packs range from ₹149 for 5 coins up to ₹1499 for 60 coins.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Q5 -->
            <div class="accordion-item accordion-item-custom">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button accordion-button-custom collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q5">
                  Do unused coins expire?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="q5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#mainFaqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                  <strong>No.</strong> Your purchased coins do not expire. They remain securely logged inside your profile wallet until you choose to utilize them.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Q6 -->
            <div class="accordion-item accordion-item-custom">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button accordion-button-custom collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q6">
                  Is my conversation private?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="q6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#mainFaqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                  Yes, privacy is a fundamental cornerstone of Talk With Ashu. Conversations are strictly confidential and are never recorded, logged, or transcribed.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Q7 -->
            <div class="accordion-item accordion-item-custom">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button accordion-button-custom collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q7">
                  Can I cancel a call?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="q7" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#mainFaqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                  Yes, you can hang up or click "Cancel" at any moment. If the call does not connect, no coins are deducted from your account.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Q8 -->
            <div class="accordion-item accordion-item-custom">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button accordion-button-custom collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q8">
                  Can I get a refund?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="q8" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#mainFaqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                  If you experience connectivity dropouts or technical issues, please submit a query through support, and we will restore your coin balance. Monetary refunds are issued within 7 days for any unused coins.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Q9 -->
            <div class="accordion-item accordion-item-custom">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button accordion-button-custom collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q9">
                  Is this a medical or therapy service?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="q9" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#mainFaqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                  <strong>No.</strong> Talk With Ashu is solely a peer support, conversational companion line. I do not provide psychiatric counseling, medical diagnoses, drug prescriptions, or therapeutic crisis treatments.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Q10 -->
            <div class="accordion-item accordion-item-custom" id="safety">
              <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button accordion-button-custom collapsed text-danger" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#q10">
                  What happens if I need emergency help?
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="q10" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#mainFaqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body text-muted">
                  If you are experiencing thoughts of self-harm, a psychiatric crisis, or any physical emergency, please immediately call your local emergency numbers (e.g., 112 in India, 911 in USA, 999 in UK) or contact national mental health helplines. This platform cannot support acute crisis interventions.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
